webrtc_native.gdextension — GDExtension manifest for the WebRTC native addon.
Source: https://github.com/godotengine/webrtc-native/releases/tag/1.1.0-stable
(godot-extension-webrtc.zip, 1.1.0-stable). Binaries: MPL-2.0 (libdatachannel);
see LICENSE.webrtc-native. Binaries installed by scripts/install-deps.sh; see
addons/webrtc-native/README.md.

The SPDX header lives in this sidecar rather than inline because Godot parses the
.gdextension as a ConfigFile (comment char ';'), and a leading '#' comment block
made the parser miss the [configuration] section ("must contain entry_symbol").
